# The local network this example is built and tested against: a world-contracts
# snapshot image, with the world already deployed. `pnpm localnet:start` runs it.
#
# To use another image, such as one you built from your own world-contracts
# changes, don't edit this file: create world.local.env (not committed) with
# your own WORLD_IMAGE line. If your image has no world-contracts commit label,
# also set WORLD_CONTRACTS_SOURCES to the checkout it was built from:
#
#   WORLD_IMAGE=world-contracts:my-change-snapshot
#   WORLD_CONTRACTS_SOURCES=../../../world-contracts
#
# Snapshot images: https://github.com/evefrontier/world-contracts/blob/dev/docker/README.md#snapshot-image
WORLD_IMAGE=ghcr.io/evefrontier/world-contracts:dev-v1.1.16-snapshot
